          %h2#definitions Definitions
          %p
            First recall some basics of
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/partial+order"} poset
          %p
            We write
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 2
                  %mo =
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
                  %mo ⊥
                  %mo →
                  %mo ⊤
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 2 = \{\bottom \to \top\}
            for the category with two objects and a single nontrivial morphism between them. Recall that a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/partial+order"} poset
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+category"} category enriched
            over
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
